{"CommitteeCode":"J32","FullName":"Joint Committee on Bonding, Capital Expenditures and State Assets","ShortName":"Bonding, Capital Expenditures and State Assets","Description":"It shall be the duty of the committee on Bonding, Capital Expenditures and State Assets to consider all matters concerning state lands, state buildings, the review all legislation providing for the giving, loaning or pledging of the credit of the Commonwealth (see Article LXII of the Amendments to the Constitution, as amended by Article LXXXIV). Said committee shall be responsible for evaluating such legislation and determining the appropriateness of enacting new legislation containing increased bond authorizations for the Commonwealth and such other matters as may be referred. ","Branch":"Joint","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"SenateChairperson":{"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"MemberCode":"EDJ0","Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/EDJ0"},"HouseChairperson":{"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"MemberCode":"MJF1","Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MJF1"},"DocumentsBeforeCommittee":[{"BillNumber":"H3873","DocketNumber":"HD3289","Title":"An Act establishing the Massachusetts social housing program","PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"M_C1","Name":"Mike Connolly","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/M_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T20:32:54.5333333"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"M_C1","Name":"Mike Connolly","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/M_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T20:32:54.5333333"},{"Id":"SBA1","Name":"Shirley B. Arriaga","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SBA1","ResponseDate":"2023-06-23T13:41:51.3766667"},{"Id":"JBE0","Name":"James B. Eldridge","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JBE0","ResponseDate":"2023-06-22T15:41:25.3933333"},{"Id":"